{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06967","headline":"林园秋夜作 · 李嶷","name":"林园秋夜作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林卧避残暑，白云长在天。\n赏心既如此，对酒非徒然。\n月色徧秋露，竹声兼夜泉。\n凉风怀袖里，兹意与谁传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嶷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}